# api-demo: FastEndpoints API (no auth).
# Start: dotnet run --project apps/api-demo/ApiDemo.csproj --launch-profile http
@host = http://localhost:5266

### Create user (anonymous)
POST {{host}}/api/user/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Jane",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "age": 30
}

### OpenAPI document
GET {{host}}/openapi/v1.json

### Scalar API reference (Development only)
GET {{host}}/scalar/v1
